// range_cond304 — ws41: a matching If-Modified-Since beside a Range: 304 wins (nginx's not_modified filter runs before the range filter).
// Expected reply generated against the pinned nginx/1.30.4 (corpus mtime
// 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z); stored pre-normalized.
--- request
GET /index.html HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1
If-Modified-Since: Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT
Range: bytes=0-9
Connection: close

--- expect
HTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified
Server: <normalized>
Date: <normalized>
Last-Modified: Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT
Connection: close
ETag: "6955b900-4f"

